{"version":1,"content":"<p>由蕭正楠、曹永廉、何廣沛主演的劇集《超時空男臣II》今日（4日）在電視城舉行開鏡拜神儀式，事隔10年開拍續集，除了3位男主角及韋家雄外，加入了不少新角色，包括戴祖儀、賴慰玲，楊明、冼靖峰、鄧伊婷、梁允瑜、李成昌、林子善等，現場蕭正楠、曹永廉</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:05:46.073549+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:15:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:58:30.369982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:58:30.369982+00:00","content_hash":"a5ae3dec0cbee35b4865eb1c04fef9eb4b85333555054647a7a27dffe24b209b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}